# Independent git repos living alongside this hub — not part of this repo.
# Ignored whole: a `dir/*` + `!dir/docs/` pair made `git add -A` record the
# nested repos as embedded gitlinks. The hub tracks only each project's built
# site, which the sync workflow copies to <project>/docs/ and adds with
# `git add -f` in CI (where those folders are not nested repos).
finance-quant/
madness/march-madness-forecaster/
nfl/nfl-player-projections/
prediction-core-main/

